  {
    "id": 432924400,
    "tag_name": "2.8.2",
    "name": "Portable Flashing Package: System Software Update 2.8.2",
    "body": "Video Fix: Resolved an issue that prevented videos from being paused reliably.\r\n\r\nVideo Stability: Improved handling of video playback to prevent the application from crashing (fixing IllegalStateException on startup).\r\n\r\nVideo Management: Enhanced logic for checking video folders to ensure that non-folder files are skipped.\r\n\r\nMultilingual Support:\r\n\r\nUser Interface (UI):\r\n\r\nImplemented a scrolling marquee effect for file names that are too long to fit on the screen.\r\n\r\nFixed several bugs related to the Theme interface.\r\n\r\nFile Management:\r\n\r\nImproved folder deletion logic to ensure all checks for video files are completed.\r\n\r\nChanged file name sorting to be case-insensitive (treating \"A\" and \"a\" the same).\r\n\r\nMusic & Video Sync:\r\n\r\nFixed a bug where the music database was not synchronized when video folders were deleted.\r\n\r\nCrucial Fix: Ensured that music playback is completely stopped when a video starts playing.\r\n\r\nDatabase: Database version updated from 3 to 4.\r\n\r\nKey Lock: Modified the Key Lock implementation to ensure it persists correctly after a restart.\r\n\r\nVideo Thumbnails: Reduced the number of concurrent processes for generating video thumbnails to prevent conflicts and improve stability.\r\n\r\nVideo Thumbnails: Optimized thumbnail generation logic, now saving thumbnails as files for better performance.\r\n\r\nVideo Error Handling: Adjusted video error detection (error code -38 is no longer treated as a playback failure).\r\n\r\nSearch/Multi-select: Fixed an issue where the multi-select status and search results were not cleared after adding items to a playlist.\r\n\r\nLocalization: Corrected German and French translations.\r\n\r\nPlayback List: Fixed issues where default playback list names were not set according to the device's primary language after a factory reset.\r\n\r\nTheming/Customization: Fixed bugs related to theme deletion and ensuring the default wallpaper is restored correctly.\r\n\r\nTheme Installation: Default themes are now copied in the background to prevent copying from stopping if the screen turns off.\r\n\r\n# You can install this update from Innioasis Updater, using SP Flash Tool, or MTK Client with the correct drivers for your system.\r\n\r\n# Simply head to www.innioasis.com/pages/download for driver, utility and update instructions for your device.\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"cb91077ce4a4198d1cd646e705899f1c8d735bce88ca7351796dd4e94c8bd9b8\",\"size\":426741145,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\"},{\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"420a5490e2f5ab99054a4d6f23b89e76c22966c639f11e9ba6c8301a72ead445\",\"size\":578051864,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\"},{\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"b65f5abf9c6b006e51cae0021db36be99a9001e9de314edbff3d515c8ba025c9\",\"size\":377164627,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-03T21:17:53Z\",\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"354f18180d2671aa3566af28e139d540ba47cb9a40b093b406e112d5f7d35369\",\"original_assets\":[\"rom.zip\",\"updater.jpg\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"rom-linux.zip\":1,\"rom-macos.zip\":3,\"rom-windows.zip\":1,\"rom.zip\":2,\"updater.jpg\":0},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-03T21:17:53Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.zip\",\"size\":187914366,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":236551244,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"}},\"v\":3} -->\n",
